   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "A breast problem: how is she PRESENTING?",
   "lines": [
    "most breast lumps are NOT cancer · the OLDER she is, the more likely any complaint is serious",
    "every one: history (age, cycle, family history) · offer a chaperone · examine both breasts + every node group"
   ]
  },
